    "text": "Which of the following statement is correct for the reactivity in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></math> reaction?",
